/**
 * BCS bytes written by Move itself: `sui::bcs::to_bytes` of real `ghosts::ghosts::Game`,
 * `ghosts::account::Account`, `Seat`, `State`, `Ending`, `history::Record`, `rules::Rules`,
 * `Matchmaker<Ranked>`, `GameStarted`, `GameEnded` and `unit::Unit` values, taken from a throwaway
 * `sui move test` on a scratch copy of the package at the working tree the SDK was aligned with
 * (never added to the repo; the printer is `fixtures-printer.move.txt`). The `game*` ones but
 * `gameScript*`, `gameFriendly*` and `gameRanked*` are the contract's own test fixture: Alice (the
 * player who waited, put first) and Bob on `map::demo_1`, one armed recruit a side (Plasma rifle,
 * Medium armor, frag grenade). The ranked ones are a game of three on Black Rain between
 * Contractors, Alice's squad committed with `RANKED.salt`. These pin the SDK's layout to the
 * contract's: a changed Move struct fails here, where a round-trip through the SDK's own schema
 * never would.
 *
 * `gameScript0` to `gameScript10` are a scripted match on an empty 8x8 map, four recruits a side,
 * with both grenades thrown, a refresh, expiries and a kill of a dazed recruit (see
 * `parity.test.ts`).
 */

